===Etymology===
[[Image:Tamil girls group.jpg|thumb|right|A group of '''girls''' in Sri Lanka.]]
From {{inh|en|enm|gerle}}, {{m|enm|girle}}, {{m|enm|gyrle|t=young person (boy or girl)}}, perhaps from {{inh|en|ang|*gyrele}},<ref>{{R:MED Online|girl(e|n|MED18637|passage=?OE *gyrela, from earlier *gurw-}}</ref> from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*gurilā}}, from a zero-grade diminutive of {{af|gmw-pro|*gaurā|t1=young child|*-ilā|nocat=1}}. Ultimately of {{unk|en|nocap=1}} origin.<ref>{{R:EWddS|hw=Gör|page=272}}</ref><ref>{{R:no:NEO|Gorre|176}}</ref> {{doublet|en|[[gal]]''/''[[gyal]]|gyaru}}.

